    <main class="w-full">
      <h1 class="sr-only" id="page-heading">Shoqëria dhe Mjedisi 4</h1>
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="boxed_text" data-section-id="pg096_sec003" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-4 py-8 bg-white"><div class="border-2 border-purple-400 bg-white overflow-hidden"><div class="flex items-stretch max-sm:flex-col"><div aria-hidden="true" class="w-44 max-lg:w-36 max-sm:w-full shrink-0 bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-5 max-sm:py-4"><div class="h-16 w-16 max-sm:h-14 max-sm:w-14 rounded-sm border-2 border-white/80 bg-white/10"></div></div><div class="flex-1 px-7 py-5 max-lg:px-5 max-lg:py-4 max-sm:px-4 max-sm:py-4"><p class="adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800"><span data-id="pg096_n0031">Pasurit&#xeb; mbitok&#xeb;sore jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjitha pasurit&#xeb; q&#xeb; gjenden mbi sip&#xeb;rfaqen e tok&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id="pg096_n0032">Pasuri mbitok&#xeb;sore jan&#xeb;: uj&#xeb;rat (lumenjt&#xeb;, liqenet, detet, oqeanet), fushat, malet, kafsh&#xeb;t e bim&#xeb;t.</span> <span data-id="pg096_n0033">Pasurit&#xeb; mbitok&#xeb;sore jan&#xeb; pasuri q&#xeb; ndikojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; zhvillimin ekonomik t&#xeb; vendit.</span> <span data-id="pg096_n0034">Druri karakterizohet si burim kryesor i ngrohjes dhe i prodhimit t&#xeb; shum&#xeb; sendeve n&#xeb; dobi t&#xeb; njeriut.</span> <span data-id="pg096_n0035">Pasurit&#xeb; ujore p&#xeb;rfshijn&#xeb; liqenet, lumenjt&#xeb;, uj&#xeb;rat minerale dhe termike.</span> <span data-id="pg096_n0036">Liqenet m&#xeb; t&#xeb; njohura jan&#xeb;: liqeni i Radoniqit, i Ujmanit, ai i Batllav&#xeb;s, i P&#xeb;rlepnic&#xeb;s dhe i Badovcit.</span> <span data-id="pg096_n0037">Nd&#xeb;rsa, lumenjt&#xeb; kryesor&#xeb; jan&#xeb;: Drini i Bardh&#xeb;, Lepenci, Morava dhe Ibri.</span> <span data-id="pg096_n0038">Uj&#xeb;rat kryesore minerale dhe termike jan&#xeb; Banja e Pej&#xeb;s, Banjska dhe Banja e Kllokotit.</span> <span data-id="pg096_n0039">T&#xeb; gjitha k&#xeb;to njihen si banja termale sh&#xeb;ruese, t&#xeb; cilat shfryt&#xeb;zohen p&#xeb;r sh&#xeb;rimin e shum&#xeb; s&#xeb;mundjeve.</span></p></div></div></div></section></div>
